        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "I am a science museum curator, and I want to build an immersive online exhibit for our \"History of Human Space Exploration\" display. Please create a scrolling web page with 5 illustrated chapters. Generate illustrations for each milestone: chapter_1.png for Sputnik 1957, chapter_2.png for Apollo moon landing 1969, chapter_3.png for the Space Shuttle era, chapter_4.png for the ISS, and chapter_5.png for a Mars colonization concept.\n",
        "source_sha256": "a046b6b408d9e460c1720c8d903cabb45f2b7cc20d3c46df5d01914146c5eabf",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
